{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「翻版林青霞」之稱的姜坤早年投考亞視藝員訓練班入行，因美貌出眾而備受力捧，但在湯鎮業追求下毅然放棄事業，兩人於1993年結婚後育有一女兩子，可惜這段婚姻僅維持了8年就結束。離婚後姜坤獨力照顧三名子女，拒絕再婚，多年來保養得宜，氣質高雅，活躍於香港頂級名媛社交圈。日前姜坤迎來生日，連日來舉行多場慶生派對，獲多位百億名媛閨密盛裝祝賀！</p><figure><img alt=\"姜坤有「翻版林青霞」之稱。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251011/1053741673135476736195206.jpeg/HoEnKcjY_l_UwTUU-MMYDx9aNbNk5zBlZF7MtmRezLY\"/><figcaption>姜坤有「翻版林青霞」之稱。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"湯鎮業與前妻姜坤育有大女湯愛嘉（Isabella）及一對孖仔湯君慈（Bruce）和湯君耀（Chris）。（IG@bruce_tong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171098653234827264236714.jpeg/cqDe25809Ysv-gvjkE5zFmpAAGAB5y3XKv4gFir-IBY\"/><figcaption>湯鎮業與前妻姜坤育有大女湯愛嘉（Isabella）及一對孖仔湯君慈（Bruce）和湯君耀（Chris）。（IG@bruce_tong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜坤同兩個兒子。（IG@christongg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251011/1053741286093361152315876.jpeg/dMCIo_Jgp7hWq3lzJ2CcqjWH_qQ3SfNHv0td3L9LXdw\"/><figcaption>姜坤同兩個兒子。（IG@christongg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"感情好。（IG@christongg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251011/1053741668039135232329851.jpeg/OA7rR4U8QUIZpNXLSg81KRGYgoFymft1apUDxWqVA8U\"/><figcaption>感情好。（IG@christongg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"保養得宜。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888172982702080061853.jpeg/lHuZnOKGJy6RhTxVllcUdOwAOslEaozjrUmdN61JnTc\"/><figcaption>保養得宜。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>湯鎮業前妻姜坤慶生透視黑絲驚艷亮相　名媛闊太齊聚排場極奢華</p><p>姜坤在IG轉發多條限時動態，人緣極佳的她獲多位名媛好友慶生，眾人齊聚高級餐廳，當中李國寶新抱、東亞銀行聯席行政總裁李民橋太太李鄺保瑜（Bonnie）、永隆銀行已故創辦人伍宜孫的孫新抱伍葉靖怡等都有出席Party，全場賓客極有默契地以全黑Dress Code亮相。身為壽星的姜坤成為焦點，她身穿黑色透視喱士上衣搭配超短熱褲，下身穿上透膚黑絲，身材線條完全不輸年輕少女，極具熟女魅力，狀態驚艷！</p><figure><img alt=\"姜坤與伍葉靖怡私交甚篤。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888184026566656278531.png/Fs4xCOHH6q6dku5HClL9yt_2a92LX66r8NWYwPDVmMA\"/><figcaption>姜坤與伍葉靖怡私交甚篤。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透視黑絲上陣。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888181413384192179586.png/Bz0SbHU8FZsQEo2v405ghITkvUnSXAAFDgDUfA4A1Hw\"/><figcaption>透視黑絲上陣。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高級餐廳慶生。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888179190272000583209.jpeg/Qnshr4vF-qplrD4lRj72_92lJBVzmPEKtWTL8LVky_A\"/><figcaption>高級餐廳慶生。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名媛好友。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888182370078720638492.jpeg/GAB0xfJUTEryGeS0t_RUjN1lrjYdHTlXu0IqPLtCKjw\"/><figcaption>名媛好友。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私交甚篤。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888686822690816350918.jpeg/zr0k_ErLSZIM2NuFbnAyjUU_hBAy3-oVsVgMNrFYDDY\"/><figcaption>私交甚篤。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"保養得宜。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251011/1053741675429892096267549.jpeg/erin1392W1s9W-hpC6gHtS9MxrXmXK55TtCznU7Qs50\"/><figcaption>保養得宜。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>姜坤逾千呎豪宅家中溫馨慶生　離婚後過貴婦生活</p><p>除了獲名媛好友慶祝之外，姜坤亦有在家中溫馨慶生，她曬出慶生照，並寫道：「願愛我和我愛的人身體健康日日開心快樂🥰」相中所見，姜坤身穿粉色格仔長衫，抱着愛犬雙手合十許願，身後放滿各方好友送上的鮮花，而枱上就有兩個生日蛋糕，分別寫有「Mami Happy Birthday」及「Christy Happy Birthday」。隨着仔女長大，姜坤亦展開新生活，不時同一班名媛闊太聚會，坐遊艇出海玩，又不時曬出逾千呎豪宅的照片，生活富貴又寫意！</p><figure><img alt=\"姜坤在家中溫馨慶生。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888180079857664162470.jpeg/OteYBTL_daHWQJlS6DFh6udnnFTfOLMGkG6PKJBujyg\"/><figcaption>姜坤在家中溫馨慶生。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜坤在家中溫馨慶生。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888177848356864437582.jpeg/Jc13ZKZ3jKxn86sz2UyK-X_WgHzgh5FRtnjMAbZ4zAE\"/><figcaption>姜坤在家中溫馨慶生。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜坤在家中溫馨慶生。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888175491026944215034.jpeg/XmwwrCWNkT6jl5v-wZY0ENVzI1lTr2WwjNWXuYzVl7k\"/><figcaption>姜坤在家中溫馨慶生。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"母子感情深厚。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888184995713024781490.jpeg/Q3HgTMI1epLIqWgiOskvNxhfqP5G4-qcSIr1gUiK9YE\"/><figcaption>母子感情深厚。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"母子感情深厚。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888182818738176471392.jpeg/vJPIGvX0ChV4otU4w3PhvQBuBeP_YiEkDI-DvgyPg74\"/><figcaption>母子感情深厚。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"活躍於上流社交圈。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888180595625984724586.jpeg/NBfRtru4eypyVrCkYgkQfpxyEUR4r1UJ679IaOu_SGg\"/><figcaption>活躍於上流社交圈。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"活躍於上流社交圈。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888177630121984859270.jpeg/eFUE4JCu5m0c3dbGKAwK1JoxN1W5CGdfUF_oKVBf6Ck\"/><figcaption>活躍於上流社交圈。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"活躍於上流社交圈。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196888175331512320061834.jpeg/oqpmFmbTT4PSCIj_3jhy188dTDQRjQuPhtXBIobVwSI\"/><figcaption>活躍於上流社交圈。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪宅佈置極有品味。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196889615181549568129087.jpeg/A7WBBhYISro97gmld3CbyGuxOHzqLdB3qD60tqg-tLY\"/><figcaption>豪宅佈置極有品味。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪宅佈置極有品味。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196889618230939648631587.jpeg/QzVLUGHL3HkATBljzghNuJwdxnYtTvU-AKth9wCrYfc\"/><figcaption>豪宅佈置極有品味。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪宅佈置極有品味。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196889621137723392601785.jpeg/20HLAOmxwlfkL9qJWKAn7BVeKkPuwt9evE2Ms7xNjLM\"/><figcaption>豪宅佈置極有品味。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:15:19.475288+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1036,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:33.698856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:08:46.314856+00:00","content_hash":"b6c356c7fe9f41412cea1